/T (Regarding indigenous people, UNHCR looks to partner with global human rights bodies to preserve their cultural heritage and also looks to help them to get official papers such as birth certificates or identifications to help them stop being stateless. They also look to fund projects like language workshops, farming tools, and fishing gear to help them preserve their tradition and lifestyle. At the same time they help to provide translation services)
/E (Regarding indigenous people, UNHCR looks to partner with global human rights bodies to preserve their cultural heritage and also looks to help them to get official papers such as birth certificates or identifications to help them stop being stateless. They also look to fund projects like language workshops, farming tools, and fishing gear to help them preserve their tradition and lifestyle. At the same time they help to provide translation services)
